        {
          "text": "\" 'Pa tsiku lachisanu ndi chiwiri muzipereka ngʼombe zazimuna zisanu ndi ziwiri, nkhosa zazimuna ziwiri ndi ana ankhosa amuna khumi ndi anayi a chaka chimodzi, zonse zopanda chilema.",
